# Stylesheet

Prefix every class this extension introduces with `panel-dock-`. Put shared look in `stylesheet.css`. Use inline `style` only for a value computed at runtime. Do not edit the shell theme under `/usr/share/gnome-shell`.

```css
/* ❌ BAD */
.panel {
    background-color: transparent;
}

/* ✅ GOOD */
.panel-dock-clock {
    padding: 0 4px;
}

/* ✅ GOOD: a shell class only narrows an extension class */
.panel-button.panel-dock-clock {
    padding: 0 4px;
}
```

Set `style_class` in the actor `_init`.
